  "details": "Just today I have seen 3 X/Twitter posts of fully AI generated worlds made using GPT-6 Astra, one of them already published.\n\nhttps://x.com/yuipxq/status/2097025460295389601\n\nhttps://x.com/kurotori4423/status/2097011323767034098\n\nhttps://x.com/pichikyo/status/2096285284178788612\n\nI fear this kind of content will soon flood the platform. VRChat needed to add some kind of AI tag or descriptor a long time ago. This kind of quickly and effortlessly generated content hurts existing creators on this platform.\n\nPlease don't let this become another \"too little, too late\" situation. VRChat needs an identifier for AI generated content added ASAP. Regardless of how end users personally feel about the use of AI, a way to separate and identify AI generated content from user created content is an absolute necessity.",
